data: {"id": "d6cf1ba9e5e5481e-thinking-parallel_evidence-1215", "run_id": "d6cf1ba9e5e5481e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，我已采集到完整的 Kubernetes 事实。现在我来整理所有已采集的证据并给出结论。\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Kubernetes Pod 状态（kubectl_describe）\n\n**Pod 当前状态：Pending，仍为异常状态，未恢复。**\n\n- **Container `app` 状态：** `Waiting`，Reason=`ImagePullBackOff`\n- **镜像：** `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing`\n- **Restart Count：** 0（从未启动过）\n- **Phase：** `Pending`（对应 Prometheus metrics 中 `kube_pod_status_phase=1` for Pending）\n\n### 2. Events 中记录的镜像拉取错误原文\n\nEvents 明确记录了以下关键错误（按时间顺序）：\n\n1. **`Failed to pull image`**（x4，over 7m28s）：\n   ```\n   failed to pull and un", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788765092528, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

