data: {"id": "d6cf1ba9e5e5481e-final", "run_id": "d6cf1ba9e5e5481e", "seq": 1220, "ts_ms": 1788765108305, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv 处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes (pod.status) | status: `Pending` | 确认 Pod 未启动 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes (event.message) | `Error: ErrImagePull` | 镜像拉取失败触发 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes (event.message) | `Error: ImagePullBackOff` | 失败后重试退避触发 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | Kubernetes (event.message) | `Failed to pull image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\": ... dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` | 直接证据：解析域名失败 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus (reason) | `ImagePullBackOff` (value: `1`) | 确认异常持续状态 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus (phase) | `Pending` (value: `1`) | 确认 Pod 阶段 |\n\nKubernetes 事件事实 4 明确指出了 `no such host` 错误，直接证实了 `ImagePullBackOff` (事实 3) 的根本原因是域名解析失败，且 Metric 数据 (事实 5, 6) 在状态上与此完全吻合。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n镜像仓库域名 registry.invalid 无效或 DNS 不可达 → kubelet DNS 解析失败 (no such host) → 镜像拉取失败触发 ErrImagePull → Pod 处于 Pending 状态且容器未启动\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为：**镜像地址 `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing` 中的域名 `registry.invalid` 不可达，导致 kubelet 无法解析 DNS 并拉取镜像**。\n\n该结论由 Kubernetes 事件 (事实 4) 中 `dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` 直接证实，表明网络层或配置层无法找到该域名对应的 IP。Metric (事实 5, 6) 佐证了 Pod 因此处于 `ImagePullBackOff` 和 `Pending` 状态。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 56.1s\n├─ 问题定位: 13.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 35.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv: 35.3s (Evidence 27.2s, RCA 8.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 56.11, "metrics": {"run_id": "d6cf1ba9e5e5481e", "mttr": {"value": "56.1s", "seconds": 56.11610794067383, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 56116.10794067383, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 52642.47274398804, "tool_calls": 13, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 8, "failed_tool_calls": 5, "tool_duration_ms": 7994.495153427124, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3145.1430320739746}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 13182.732343673706, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 35279.74319458008, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_